# Card photos ARE committed. They have to be: a deployed instance only runs
# `npm ci && npm run build`, so anything fetched at development time would be
# missing in production and every card would fall back to generated art.
# Every image is CC or public domain, redistribution is permitted with
# attribution, and the in-game credits page provides it.
# The contact sheet is a local review artefact, not part of the game.
public/cards/contact-sheet.html

